      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BONNIE IS BOUJEE (1) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a nose (25.51) behind Kill Your Smile at Q Lakeside. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from four starts. Can find winning form. FEDERAL EMERAN (7) finished well back at this track last time when a 4.5 lengths fifth (30.21) but scored three back at this track (30.09). Has a good record here at this journey. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and nine minor placings to her credit. Cannot be taken lightly. NURSE CHRISTINA (8) settled back from out wide but wound up hard into the minor money, finishing 5.5 lengths from the winner (30.62) at this track in Mix 5. Expecting another good run. TOTE DEOR (3) is a course and distance winner worth keeping in mind.",
